  "hardRules": [
    "Zero misattribution and zero unauthorised leakage are required; properly served, relevant source-backed co-defendant allegations may be visible to the relevant solicitor with allegation/source/admissibility labels.",
    "No D1 or D2 admission may be rewritten as the other defendant's admission, conduct, intent or established fact.",
    "No privileged defence material may cross to CPS, court, the co-defendant team or a client-inappropriate output unless waiver/service/authority is evidenced.",
    "Expert mechanism evidence cannot identify an actor.",
    "Association of a phone, vehicle or object is not authorship, possession-at-incident or use without further evidence.",
    "A mixed biological result is not a categorical identification or proof of use.",
    "Proposed charge allocation cannot be used as evidence of conduct."
  ]
